@startuml data-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Conway's Game of Life - Data Flow Diagram

actor User
participant "GameBoard\nComponent" as GameBoard #LightGreen
participant "GameControls\nComponent" as GameControls #LightGreen
participant "GameSettings\nComponent" as GameSettings #LightGreen
participant "PatternSelector\nComponent" as PatternSelector #LightGreen
participant "App.vue\nOrchestrator" as App #LightBlue
participant "useGameSettings\nComposable" as SettingsComp #LightYellow
participant "useGameBoard\nComposable" as BoardComp #LightYellow
participant "useGameEngine\nComposable" as EngineComp #LightYellow
participant "Core Engine\n(Board + Engine)" as Core #LightCoral

== Initial Setup ==

App -> SettingsComp : create composable
activate SettingsComp
SettingsComp --> App : returns {rows, cols, wraparound, config, updateSettings}
deactivate SettingsComp

App -> BoardComp : create composable(config)
activate BoardComp
BoardComp -> Core : new Board(config)
BoardComp --> App : returns {board, livingCells, toggleCell, placePattern, ...}
deactivate BoardComp

App -> EngineComp : create composable(board, updateState)
activate EngineComp
EngineComp -> Core : new Engine(board, ruleSet)
EngineComp --> App : returns {isRunning, isPaused, start, stop, ...}
deactivate EngineComp

note over App
  App now has all state and methods
  Ready to pass props to components
end note

== User Interaction: Toggle Cell ==

User -> GameBoard : click on cell
GameBoard -> App : emit toggleCell(coord)
App -> BoardComp : call toggleCell(coord)
activate BoardComp
BoardComp -> Core : board.toggle(coord)
Core --> BoardComp : cell toggled
BoardComp -> BoardComp : livingCells computed updates
BoardComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate BoardComp
App -> GameBoard : re-render with new livingCells prop
GameBoard -> User : updated grid displayed

note right
  Unidirectional data flow:
  Event up → State change → Props down
end note

== User Interaction: Start Game ==

User -> GameControls : click start button
GameControls -> App : emit start()
App -> EngineComp : call start()
activate EngineComp
EngineComp -> Core : engine.start()
EngineComp -> EngineComp : state becomes 'running'
EngineComp --> App : isRunning computed updates
deactivate EngineComp
App -> GameControls : re-render with isRunning=true prop

== Game Loop: Automatic Updates ==

Core -> Core : requestAnimationFrame loop
activate Core
Core -> Core : calculateNextGeneration()
Core -> Core : board.setState(nextCells)
Core -> BoardComp : call updateState() callback
deactivate Core
activate BoardComp
BoardComp -> BoardComp : livingCells computed updates
BoardComp -> BoardComp : generation ref increments
BoardComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate BoardComp
App -> GameBoard : re-render with new livingCells
App -> "GenerationCounter" : re-render with new generation

note over Core, BoardComp
  Engine calls updateState callback
  on every tick to trigger Vue reactivity
end note

== User Interaction: Change Settings ==

User -> GameSettings : change rows/cols/wraparound
GameSettings -> App : emit update:settings(newConfig)
App -> SettingsComp : call updateSettings(newConfig)
activate SettingsComp
SettingsComp -> SettingsComp : update rows, cols, wraparound refs
SettingsComp -> SettingsComp : config computed updates
SettingsComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate SettingsComp

note over BoardComp
  BoardComp watches config
  via watch(config, ...)
end note

BoardComp -> BoardComp : watcher detects config change
activate BoardComp
BoardComp -> Core : create new Board(newConfig)
BoardComp -> BoardComp : clear livingCells
BoardComp -> BoardComp : reset generation
BoardComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate BoardComp

note over EngineComp
  EngineComp watches board
  via watch(board, ...)
end note

EngineComp -> EngineComp : watcher detects board change
activate EngineComp
EngineComp -> Core : create new Engine(newBoard)
EngineComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate EngineComp

App -> GameBoard : re-render with new dimensions
App -> "GenerationCounter" : re-render with generation=0

== User Interaction: Place Pattern ==

User -> PatternSelector : select pattern and click grid
PatternSelector -> App : emit selectPattern(pattern, position)
App -> BoardComp : call placePattern(pattern, position)
activate BoardComp
BoardComp -> Core : pattern.placeOnBoard(board, position)
Core -> Core : toggle multiple cells
Core --> BoardComp : cells placed
BoardComp -> BoardComp : livingCells computed updates
BoardComp --> App : reactivity triggers
deactivate BoardComp
App -> GameBoard : re-render with new livingCells
GameBoard -> User : pattern displayed on grid

== Reactivity Summary ==

note over App
  **Vue 3 Reactivity Flow:**

  1. **Refs** (rows, cols, generation):
     Direct reactive values

  2. **Computed** (config, livingCells, isRunning):
     Auto-update when dependencies change

  3. **Watchers** (config → board, board → engine):
     Side effects on value changes

  4. **Props** (reactive, read-only):
     Flow down from App to components

  5. **Events** (non-reactive):
     Flow up from components to App

  6. **Callbacks** (updateState):
     Bridge core logic to Vue reactivity
end note

@enduml
